BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Meet People Lancaster
UID:event_316903387@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261024T043254Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261028T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261028T203000
SUMMARY:Trivia Night at Southern Market - Meet People Lancaster team
DESCRIPTION:Meet People Lancaster\nDo you love trivia nights\, but want to
  avoid the hassle of trying to wrangle up enough friends to field a team? 
 Come play for a Meet People Lancaster team and make some new friends along
  the way!\nCost: FREE\nBar & food stations are all walk up. You’ll be on
  your own tab for the night.\nHost: Elizabeth Chapman\nPlease try to get t
 here by 6:30PM\, so we can get situated at a couple tables. Trivia starts 
 at 7PM. If you come early\, you’ll have time to mingle and get some food
  before trivia starts.\n\nLocation: 100 S Queen St\, Lancaster\, PA 17603\
 nHow to find the group: Our “usual” trivia spot is the tables in front
  of Gloomy Rooster/Noodle King in the front left corner. We will also have
  a few yellow MPL signs!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/meet-people-lancaster/events/31690338
 7/
